		line=1124,
	},
	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat760010b"},
		line=1124,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"The bilateral trade negotiations with the Republic began at the crack of dawn and continued all throughout the day.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"Only once the clock reached nine was the conference adjourned, with proceedings set to continue tomorrow morning.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Elsa, Empress Hisui, and Shino immediately retired back to the governor-general's office to debrief the day's events.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Naturally, I accompanied them as part of my guard duties.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“We managed to settle the first three points on the agenda.\nThat's a lot better than I expected.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“I am pleased that everything went so smoothly.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Well, the sticking point was always gonna be the tariff package, but the way things're going, we should be able to come to an agreement.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Speaking purely as an observer, their teamwork today was spectacular.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
{"font", size=51},
"Shino spearheaded each round of negotiations, and whenever the Republicans tried to find fault with her proposals, Elsa was there to support her with a precise counterargument.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"If anyone still tried to press the issue, Kanami slid in to pacify their protests with a winsome smile and a freshly brewed cup of tea.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Empress Hisui, your presence was truly invaluable, and for that, you have my deepest gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Hehee, there is no need for that. All I did was simply serve some tea.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Besides, the opportunity to see our plans fall into place was its own reward.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Kanami pokes out her tongue with a mischievous grin.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Your Majesty, do try and be more mindful of how you comport yourself in front of your subjects.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"Elsa retorts with an exasperated sigh.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Well then, I'll be escorting Her Majesty back to the Imperial Palace now. What about you, Shino?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“There's still a few documents I wanna give a look over.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“D'you mind sticking around a bit longer, Soujin?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As you wish.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Will you two be all right, Elsa?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“No need to worry about us. Inou-san will be there to see to Her Majesty's protection.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then you're in good hands.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"As of yet, the anti-peace faction hasn't made any moves.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Hopefully, things stay that way and everything ends without incident.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Elsa"},
			{
"“Come, Your Majesty, let us be off.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Empress Hisui"},
			{
"“Very well. I bid you all a good evening.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"The two step out of the governor-general's office.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Man, I'm totally beat...”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"Shino leans all the way back in her chair with a big stretch.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you want, I can massage your shoulders for you.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hahaha, I appreciate the thought, at least.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“But as you can see, I'm a delicate maiden. A warrior's massage would snap my body like a twig.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Even I know how to control my strength.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Just kidding, dude.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You really are a funny guy, you know? Not that that's anything new.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"She lets out another big stretch, flashing me a carefree grin.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Seriously, though, thanks for being my bodyguard today. I was able to focus on the negotiations 'cause I knew you had my back.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm simply glad to have been of service.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Oh, you better believe you were. Countin' on ya tomorrow, too.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Though her words are light, the smile she shows me is honest and sincere.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"Perhaps it's because of her mixed heritage, but you rarely see Imperials wearing such an open-hearted smile.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Right, time to buckle down and get this done.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you sure you don't want to get some rest?”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Not when everything's been leading up to this.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Shino declares emphatically, absently rolling up her sleeves.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Oops, should be a bit more careful doing that in front of a guy.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It doesn't bother me if you want to roll up your sleeves.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Yeah, it's a force of habit from the way my old woman\nwouldn't shut up about the proper way a lady ought to behave...”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"Makes me wonder how she's okay with wearing such a short skirt, but I suppose that's a difference only women can understand.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You might not believe it, but I ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"am",
{"/font"},
" still a girl, you know? Wanting to receive flowers, dreaming of a prince in shining armor who'll whisk me away, that's all part of the deal.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Go right ahead, laugh it up.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, I didn't say anything.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Oh, yeah? Well, aren't you open-minded?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"Smirking to herself, Shino turns back towards her paperwork.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"That puts an end to our conversation.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"Within seconds, she's fully immersed herself in her work.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"I can't afford to sit back idly either.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Straightening my back, I sharpen my senses and continually scan the surroundings for danger.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"About ten minutes pass.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"The only sound in the room comes from the scratching of\nShino's fountain pen.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"She hasn't so much as touched the tea I prepared for her.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Lost in a world of her own, the only thing she sees are the documents before her.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"In the world of business, negotiations are the stage upon which life-and-death battles are fought.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"And people are at their most beautiful when they are doing battle.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Naturally, Shino is no exception.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"The cold steel glint in her eyes is nothing short of mesmerizing.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...?!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"The premonition of danger races up my spine like an electric shock.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"In the next moment─",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Aaaahh?!”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"A thunderous rumble shakes the air.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"I can't tell if it was on the first or the second floor, but that was definitely the sound of an explosion somewhere in the building.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"I reach out to grab Shino by the arm as she nearly tumbles out of her chair.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Was that an explosion?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No doubt about it.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hyaah?!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Another explosion rocks the building.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Before the shaking even subsides, bursts of gunfire begin ringing out.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"They must be trying to storm the Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"We need to get out of here. Now.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Making up my mind, I draw my spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You're gonna fight?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, we're getting out of here!”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"I slash a hole in the ceiling to create an escape route.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You can't be serious!”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If we leave through the window, we're likely to get shot.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's go.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"I pull Shino towards me and lift her up in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hwah! S-Soujin?!”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry, try to bear with it.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"I leap up through the hole in the ceiling and land on the roof of the Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"The firefight continues to rage on, but no bullets come flying in our direction.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Seems like we haven't been discovered yet.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"I quickly survey the surroundings, spotting a row of military depots and barracks leading away from the roof\nwe're on.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Looks like that's going to be our best escape route.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're jumping to the roof of that barracks there. Don't bite your tongue.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“S-Seriously? That's at least, like, thirty meters─”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's nothing!”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"I dash towards the edge of the roof─",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"And leap into the air at the last possible second.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"The two of us soar through the night sky.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Nh...”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"Shino clings tightly to my chest.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"Her trembling frame is ever so light in my arms.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"Despite the adrenaline coursing through me, I'm still acutely aware of her womanly softness pressing against me.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"As soon as I land on the roof of the nearby barracks, I leap into the air once more.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"After two more bounds, I manage to put over a hundred meters between us and the Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Shino, we're safe now.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"Still clinging to me, Shino's eyes are squeezed firmly shut.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Shino.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Her hands tremble as she clutches desperately at my shirt.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Though I've long since grown numb to the terrors of battle, it must surely be a terrifying thing for a civilian to experience.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"I continue to cradle Shino in my arms as I wait for her to calm down.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Suddenly, the distant gunfire subsides.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"The fighting must have come to an end.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Based on the state of the Government-General, the attackers must have either retreated or been wiped out.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"It's hard to assess the extent of the damages, but at least we can rest easy for now.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Shino, it's all over now.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Finally...”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Shino hesitantly blinks her eyes open.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Her violet eyes, peering up at me timidly, are still clouded with fear.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You can relax now.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Y-Yeah...”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Sorry, I-I still can't get my thoughts together.”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't blame you.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why don't we just take in the scenery for now?”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"The entire Tenkyo nightscape extends out from the roof of the warehouse we're perched upon.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"The city lights were never this bright when we were under the Republic's occupation.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"But now, a veritable sea of twinkling lights is reflected in\nShino's eyes, serving as proof of the Empire's newfound vitality.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"This nightscape vista is every bit as breathtaking as the starry sky itself.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"Yet the beauty of the girl in my arms is enough to put them both to shame.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Her chiseled features are faintly illumined by the shimmering city lights.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"The soft luminescence serves as the perfect adornment for her long eyelashes and high cheekbones.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Her impossibly fair skin, proof of the Republican blood running through her veins, glows lucently in the pale moonlight.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I'm a little calmer now.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's good to hear.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You must have ice in your veins, though. Have you really gotten so used to gunshots and explosions?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Allowing fear to consume you on the battlefield gets you killed.”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Sure, anyone can ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"tell",
{"/font"},
" themselves that.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't think it's any different from the way you keep your cool at the negotiation table.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Isn't that a battlefield like any other?”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hmm, good point.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It might be less direct, but it's true that lots of lives are hanging in the balance.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"Economics have a direct impact on human life.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"The current trade negotiations, for example, are apparently so important that a single wrong step would rob the Empire of its future.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Though her arena is very different from mine, there's no doubt that Shino is also fighting a life-and-death struggle.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right, let's start making our way back to the Government-General.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Ah, umm...”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's the matter? I'm sure everyone's worried about you.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Can't we stay here a little longer?”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			{
"Shino whispers, putting more strength into her arms around my back.",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"The softness of her body presses against me.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Back when I was in the Republic, I once saw a movie with a scene just like this.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You know, some rich heiress getting rescued by her bodyguard.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh? What happened after that?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Whaddaya mean? They fell in love, obviously.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It'd make for one lame story if they just went back to business as usual, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You have a point there.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hahaha, that's such a Soujin way to respond.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"Shino laughs to herself, her words inscrutable.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“It's weird for me to fantasize about these sorta stories,\ndon'tcha think?”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"She said the same thing back when we were in the\ngovernor-general's office.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It feels like you've got it in your head that you're not allowed to act like a girl.”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“That's the truth.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I never really learned how to talk like a proper lady, and besides, the world I grew up in is one where all your femininity amounts to nothing anyways.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
{"font", size=53},
"“It's all one big load of crap, isn't it? The business world says it doesn't matter if you're a girl or a guy, but you've gotta work harder than any guy if you wanna get anywhere.”",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Calling it a meritocracy sounds nice and all, but really, if you wanna survive, you might as well forget all about being a girl.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Shino concludes her monologue with a deep sigh.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"The sort of sigh that suggests she should've thought better about saying all that.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Speaking for a friend, of course.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Yeah, that's a lie.)”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Even I can tell that much.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You know, I've never once thought you were lacking in femininity.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Oh, stop it. I wasn't fishing for compliments.”",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That wasn't meant to be flattery.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If I'm being honest, I probably can't understand your problems all that well.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But still, I think even if you aren't feminine in the way the world expects you to be, you're fine just the way you are.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“If only things were that easy.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Despite her facetious remark, though, her expression eases ever so slightly.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Um, besides, from holding you like this, it's abundantly clear that you're a woman.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“D-Dude, you can't be seriously saying stuff like that right now.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“You'll make me blush...”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Shino curls up inside my arms.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Put me down already.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Not happening.”",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Just do it.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You expect to climb down from the roof on your own?”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"It's at least a ten-meter drop from here to the ground below.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“≪Shit...≫”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Huh? Well, I suppose if you had a big enough sheet...”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Forget about it.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"For as much as Shino claims she's hardly a woman, I still\nhaven't the slightest clue what she's thinking.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Man, talk about a rock and a hard place.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Shino mutters with resignation as she leans against me.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"I'm reminded again that she isn't lacking one bit in femininity.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"The softness of her body is wholly different from that of a\nman's, enough to make it feel like I'm the one being embraced by her.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It wasn't appropriate for me to comment on your body.\nI'm sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Nah, it's cool.”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“If anything... it made me a little happy.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Turning her face away from me, Shino adds that last part in a barely audible whisper.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"A wave of heat washes over my chest, and I'm suddenly overcome with the urge to hold her tight.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sure the actor in the movie you watched would have the perfect line to say right about now.”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“I know better than to expect smooth talk from a warrior.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Heh.”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“In exchange, how 'bout you take me for another ride?”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Bring me back to the Government-General in a way only a warrior can.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"That I can do.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Here we go!”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"I take a running start before leaping into the night sky.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Whoooaaa! It's like we're flying!”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Without consciously meaning to, I leapt a little higher, a little farther than I usually would.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"─Perhaps I wanted us to be able to soar just a little longer.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			{
"─Perhaps I wanted to bring some joy to this delicate-yet-strong girl who fights with all her heart on a battlefield so different from my own.",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"Surely, those were the sentiments filling up my heart at the moment I took to the sky.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“The suspension bridge effect, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's that?”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Nothing. Don't worry about it.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“And don't you dare look it up later, you hear?”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"Giggling to herself, Shino gently rests her cheek against my chest.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"A few moments later, we land in the courtyard of the Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're here.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Thanks, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"The Government-General is a flurry of activity, with paramedics tending to the wounded and security forces securing the perimeter.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"On top of that, several media outlets gathered to report on the trade negotiations have already begun broadcasting coverage of the attack.",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"The moment Shino approaches the building, she's sure to be swarmed.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There's a whole bunch of reporters there. Are you sure you wanna deal with that right now?”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“If they keep reporting me as missing, there'll be even bigger problems.”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Time for just another day at the office.”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"Putting on her game face, Shino motions for me to set her down.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Whoa, whoa... whoa!”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"I immediately catch her as she staggers on her feet.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Gee, that's weird. My legs totally feel like jelly.”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Should I carry you then?”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“We're gonna be on national TV. Half the audience is gonna spit out their tea at a spectacle like that.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Lend me your arm. We'll just say I sprained my ankle.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			{
"With Shino leaning on my shoulder, the two of us hobble our way towards the Government-General.",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"Sure enough, before we even make it halfway, a swarm of reporters stops us in our tracks.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"They don't even give Shino a chance to get a word in edgewise before they start bombarding her with questions.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
"Leaning on me all the while, Shino deftly answers each question in turn.",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"For someone as canny as Shino, there's no way she'd let a crisis like this go to waste.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"She takes full advantage of the media spotlight to emphasize the complexity of the trade negotiations and the competency of the Kurushima Group.",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"The scared girl trembling with terror mere moments ago is nowhere to be seen.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"In her place is a woman fearlessly facing down the cameras with eyes full of resolute will, going as far as to leverage her unsteady gait to win more sympathy.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(She's incredible.)”",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"As someone who's lived their whole life as a warrior, the world of commerce and industry has always seemed impossibly foreign.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"But here and now, in the face of Shino's remarkable strength, I've gained a newfound respect for her.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"Enough to make me want to know more and more about her.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"Without realizing it, I pour more of my strength into the arm supporting Shino.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Shino"},
			{
"“Hey, we're on camera, you know.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah, sorry.”",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"One of the reporters suddenly has the idea to ask about our relationship.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"And he directs the question to me, of all people.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"I immediately break out in a cold sweat.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am but a humble bodyguard.”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“'Tis not my place to speak on the matter.”",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
